 585:source\asw/mp3.c ****  * if needed, and fill the inactive sound buffer.
 586:source\asw/mp3.c ****  * Always produces up to SOUND_BUFFER_SIZE samples, so ISR timing is
 587:source\asw/mp3.c ****  * identical for 8-bit and 16-bit files.
 588:source\asw/mp3.c ****  *   8-bit : read 512 bytes  -> 512 samples (used as-is)
 589:source\asw/mp3.c ****  *   16-bit: read 1024 bytes -> 512 samples (converted in place)
